    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1019 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking strong thunderstorms along a line extending from near Perth to Considine to near Maza. Movement was east at 30 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Locations impacted include... Cando, Munich, Bisbee, Starkweather, Rocklake, Egeland, and Calio.",
